# A UV sphere, 20 slices by 10 stacks. Quads in the middle bands and
# triangles at the poles, which is what an exported sphere normally looks like.
# v/t near 0.5 is the limit Euler gives a closed triangle mesh.
#
# Generated geometry, committed so the loader and the mesh benchmarks
# have something with shared vertices to work on.

